{"compatibility":"minor","safety_note_md":"# SafeStan Safety Note

Compatibility: minor.

Protected data: `y`.

Generated files: `model_safe.stan`, `data_safe.json`.

Changes: reordered the model-block sampling statements so that `mu` is given its built-in prior before it is used in the prior for `theta`. The posterior density is unchanged because the same sampling statements are retained and only their order is changed. No data changes were required; `sigma` and `J` remain unprotected context inputs.
","model_safe_stan":"data {
  int<lower=0> J; // number of schools
  array[J] real y; // estimated treatment
  array[J] real<lower=0> sigma; // std of estimated effect
}
parameters {
  array[J] real theta; // treatment effect in school j
  real mu; // hyper-parameter of mean
  real<lower=0> tau; // hyper-parameter of sdv
}
model {
  tau ~ cauchy(0, 5); // a non-informative prior
  mu ~ normal(0, 5);
  theta ~ normal(mu, tau);
  y ~ normal(theta, sigma);
}
","data_safe_json":"{"J":2,"sigma":[2.1523142053114706,2.4109308350354977],"y":[5.022419251569275,6.113012827085329]}","protected_variables":["y"]}
